mojo-tinygltf

This project is a derived Mojo port of tinygltf:
https://github.com/syoyo/tinygltf

Ported from upstream revision a434ee02066c2d9b62a3504876aed38e6e399fe0.
tinygltf is Copyright (c) 2017 Syoyo Fujita, Aurélien Chatelain and
contributors and is distributed under the MIT License. Its license text is
reproduced in LICENSE by the terms common to both projects.

The implementation follows tiny_gltf.h functions GetComponentSizeInBytes,
GetNumComponentsInType, Accessor::ByteStride, ParseNode,
TinyGLTF::LoadBinaryFromMemory, and WriteBinaryGltfStream, together with the
sparse patch and matrix kernels in examples/glview/glview.cc and
examples/common/matrix.cc.
